{"pin":"BH09855","subcodes":[{"code":"BH09855","anchor":"","first_line":"Praised be Thou, O Lord my God! Graciously grant that this infant be fed from the breast of Thy tender mercy","first_line_orig":"سبحانک اللهم یا الهی هذا رضیع فاشربه من ثدی رحمتک و عنایتک ثم ارزقه من فواکه  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"90","full_text_parts":["Praised be Thou, O Lord my God! Graciously grant that this infant be fed from the breast of Thy tender mercy and loving providence and be nourished with the fruit of Thy celestial trees. Suffer him not to be committed to the care of anyone save Thee, inasmuch as Thou, Thyself, through the potency of thy sovereign will and power, didst create and call him into being. There is none other God but Thee, the Almighty, the All-Knowing.\n\nLauded art Thou, O my Best Beloved, waft over him the sweet savors of Thy transcendent bounty and the fragrances of Thy holy bestowals. Enable him then to seek shelter beneath the shadow of Thy most exalted Name, O Thou Who holdest in Thy grasp the kingdom of names and attributes. Verily, Thou art potent to do what Thou willest, and Thou art indeed the Mighty, the Exalted, the Ever-Forgiving, the Gracious, the","Generous, the Merciful."],"translations":[{"language":"lb","lang_name":"Luxembourgish"},{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"language":"gil","lang_name":"Gilbertese"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15725.369c","source":"BLIB_Or15725","locator":"369c"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA92:144b","source":"INBA92","locator":"144b","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v092-dark/?page=74"},{"kind":"music","code":"E. Mahony","source":"E","locator":"Mahony","url":"https://music.elikamahony.com/track/prayer-for-infants"},{"kind":"music","code":"almunajat.com [item 39]","source":"almunajat","locator":"com [item 39]","url":"https://almunajat.com/chanting_collection_2.htm"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM2#114 p.203","source":"ADM2","locator":"114 p.203","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/558.pdf#page=203"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMTF.005","source":"MMTF","locator":"005","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/66.pdf#page=5"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.032","source":"BPRY","locator":"032","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/004530097"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_CHILD#01","source":"BRL_CHILD","locator":"01","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/322229382"}]},{"code":"BH09855INF","anchor":"inf","translations":[{"language":"ml","lang_name":"Malayalam"},{"language":"ru","lang_name":"Russian"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"haw","lang_name":"Hawaiian"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"zh-Hant","lang_name":"Traditional Chinese"},{"language":"lb","lang_name":"Luxembourgish"},{"language":"lg","lang_name":"Ganda"},{"language":"sv","lang_name":"Swedish"},{"language":"tl","lang_name":"Tagalog"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"th","lang_name":"Thai"},{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"iba","lang_name":"Iban"},{"language":"tk","lang_name":"Turkmen"},{"language":"mt","lang_name":"Maltese"},{"language":"ja","lang_name":"Japanese"},{"language":"gux","lang_name":"Gourmanchéma"},{"language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"language":"mn","lang_name":"Mongolian"},{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"da","lang_name":"Danish"},{"language":"fr","lang_name":"French"},{"language":"gu","lang_name":"Gujarati"},{"language":"ta","lang_name":"Tamil"},{"language":"bn","lang_name":"Bengali"},{"language":"eo","lang_name":"Esperanto"},{"language":"ko","lang_name":"Korean"},{"language":"hu","lang_name":"Hungarian"},{"language":"pl","lang_name":"Polish"},{"language":"ca","lang_name":"Catalan"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"el","lang_name":"Greek"},{"language":"tr","lang_name":"Turkish"},{"language":"is","lang_name":"Icelandic"},{"language":"ht","lang_name":"Haitian Creole"},{"language":"fo","lang_name":"